sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Dashboard
    participant KubeAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Controller as odh-model-controller<br/>9443/TCP Webhook<br/>8443/TCP Metrics
    participant MSA as model-serving-api<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over KubeAPI,Controller: Flow 1: InferenceService Reconciliation
        KubeAPI->>Controller: Watch event: InferenceService CR<br/>HTTPS / SA token
        Controller->>KubeAPI: Create Route<br/>HTTPS / SA token
        Controller->>KubeAPI: Create NetworkPolicy<br/>HTTPS / SA token
        Controller->>KubeAPI: Create ServiceAccount + RoleBinding<br/>HTTPS / SA token
        Controller->>KubeAPI: Create ServiceMonitor / PodMonitor<br/>HTTPS / SA token
        Controller->>KubeAPI: Create KEDA TriggerAuthentication<br/>HTTPS / SA token
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over KubeAPI,Controller: Flow 2: LLMInferenceService Lifecycle
        KubeAPI->>Controller: Watch event: LLMInferenceService CR<br/>HTTPS / SA token
        Controller->>KubeAPI: Create SA, Role, RoleBinding, Secret<br/>HTTPS / SA token
        Controller->>KubeAPI: Create KEDA TriggerAuthentication<br/>HTTPS / SA token
        Controller->>KubeAPI: Create Kuadrant AuthPolicy<br/>HTTPS / SA token
        Controller->>KubeAPI: Update LLMInferenceService status<br/>HTTPS / SA token
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over User,MSA: Flow 3: Gateway Discovery API
        User->>MSA: GET /api/v1/gateways<br/>HTTPS / Bearer token
        MSA->>KubeAPI: SelfSubjectAccessReview<br/>HTTPS / User token
        KubeAPI-->>MSA: Authorization result
        MSA->>KubeAPI: List Gateways, Get Namespace<br/>HTTPS / SA token
        KubeAPI-->>MSA: Gateway list
        MSA-->>User: JSON response<br/>HTTPS
    end

    rect rgb(255, 230, 230)
        Note over KubeAPI,Controller: Flow 4: Admission Webhook
        KubeAPI->>Controller: POST /mutate-...-inferenceservice<br/>HTTPS 443→9443 / service-CA cert
        Controller-->>KubeAPI: AdmissionReview response<br/>(admit/deny + mutations)
    end
